{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H2zBtKSF6VtUnhos5qH1Vp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tNo P0 or false declared condition found in payload 18. Benign Python 3.9 checks passed for original-text offsets, overlapping redactions, extracted imports, facade globals and policy exports.\n2\t\n3\tNEW FINDINGS (annex)\n4\tNone.\n5\t\n6\tP2 follow-ups\n7\tP2 — .claude/scripts/tier_policy_cli/learn.py:832, integrating .claude/hooks/_lib/model_currency.py:39: Tournament aggregation now accepts model-family IDs absent from the fixed tier ranking. When such an ID wins, its rank of -1 produces an actionable demotion requiring a signature, but owner-sign rejects that ID at cli.py:337 and application rejects it at apply.py:401. The adopter receives a recommendation that cannot complete. Minimal fix: emit a hold with an unknown-rank reason until ranking, signing and application support the same IDs.\n8\t\n9\tVERDICT: GO The applicable declared claims hold in this payload, with one nonblocking model-learning integration follow-up.\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a25f8a7-7747-4a27-bd7f-b0b8e6b81433","uuid":"39221541-9a49-49eb-b9fa-3a2f3307f08c","timestamp":"2026-11-16T19:10:20.650Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/kit-repass-tree.n5R3O9/tree/.claude/plans/PLAN-198/repass-rc1/codex-rc1-18.verdict.txt","content":"No P0 or false declared condition found in payload 18. Benign Python 3.9 checks passed for original-text offsets, overlapping redactions, extracted imports, facade globals and policy exports.\n\nNEW FINDINGS (annex)\nNone.\n\nP2 follow-ups\nP2 — .claude/scripts/tier_policy_cli/learn.py:832, integrating .claude/hooks/_lib/model_currency.py:39: Tournament aggregation now accepts model-family IDs absent from the fixed tier ranking. When such an ID wins, its rank of -1 produces an actionable demotion requiring a signature, but owner-sign rejec